  "body": "Discover modern living at its finest at Gulf Harbour - a beautifully crafted, high-spec family home designed for comfort and style.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nBrand New Build: Just completed, this quality home is ready for you to move in and make it your own.\r\nSpacious Layout: Set close to Council Reserve, with seamless flow throughout.\r\nOpen-Plan Living: A bright, spacious living and dining area, complemented by a designer kitchen. Two sliding doors lead to a large wrap-around deck-perfect for entertaining.\r\nWarmth and Comfort: Insulated in the ceiling and walls, gas hot water system, plus a central Aircon in the living ensures comfort all year round.\r\nPrivate Master Retreat:  the master suite boasts a tiled ensuite, walk-in wardrobe \r\nFamily-Friendly : Two double bedrooms with generous wardrobes and a stylish family bathroom.\r\nLight-Filled Design:  lights wells bring sunshine, warmth and modern flair to the home.\r\nExtra-Large A Carpeted Garage : Featuring an automatic door \r\nAmple Parking: Additional off-street parking\r\nFully Landscaped: Beautifully finished grounds to complement the home's quality build.\r\nAffordable luxury awaits. \r\nDon't miss your chance to own this stunning new home. \r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing.",
